THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES for the imbh distributed binaries (imbhd and imbh-tui)

This file lists the third-party crates that may be linked into the distributed imbh binaries --
imbhd (imbh-server) and imbh-tui -- together with their licenses and the full text of each
license. It is generated by cargo-about across the whole workspace with all features enabled and
for every published target, so it is deliberately a SUPERSET of what any single binary links: a
crate listed here is not necessarily present in the build you are holding. Do not edit by hand;
regenerate with ./scripts/gen-notices.sh.

